OrangeIslands_Sunburst_Glassworks_Text_Glassblower::
	.string "Fifty years I have worked glass on\n"
	.string "this island.\p"
	.string "The sand here is wrong, you know.\n"
	.string "Too much of the hill in it. Melt\l"
	.string "it and it comes out clear as\l"
	.string "water and twice as hard.\p"
	.string "That is not sand doing that. That\n"
	.string "is whatever the hill is made of.$"

OrangeIslands_Sunburst_Glassworks_Text_Daughter::
	.string "He went down into the cave once,\n"
	.string "years ago, and came back up\l"
	.string "without his tools.\p"
	.string "He has never said why.\n"
	.string "He has never gone back either.$"

